    "created_at": "2016-01-10T17:30:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-10T17:30:43Z",
    "body": "This will need to be rebased on top of #443, if people think it's worth taking. @domenic?\n\nI think this is somewhat clearer; it removes the repeated checking for the \"src\" attribute, and it's more obvious that there is a \"The task that the networking task source places on the task queue once fetching has completed must …\" requirement if and only if we're doing a fetch.\n\nIt might also be better to switch the no-src case to have an early return; thoughts welcome.\n",
