    "created_at": "2016-01-20T22:09:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-20T22:09:02Z",
    "body": "So, after #443, there is not as clear of a difference: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#prepare-a-script\n\nIn particular, modules go down many of the same paths classic scripts do, but they do not switch on the presence or absence of a src attribute.\n\nI think that means the idea behind this PR will not work as well in the new algorithm. Happy to reopen if you have other ideas.\n",
